# Personal zsh overrides — copy to ".overrides.zsh" (gitignored) and edit.
# Sourced LAST, so anything here wins over features and project config.
# Live: any new terminal picks up edits, no rebuild.

# Your own prompt / theme:
# PROMPT='%~ %# '
# RPROMPT=''

# Reuse a feature's prompt segment in your own prompt — e.g. the k8s feature
# exposes kube_context_prompt (echoes " ⎈ <context>:<namespace>"):
# RPROMPT=''
# PROMPT='%~ $(kube_context_prompt) %# '

# Silence a feature's prompt segment while keeping the default prompt:
# export K8S_HIDE_CONTEXT=1

# Personal aliases:
# alias ll='ls -lah'
